'''Santa''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2015 Christmas Knife Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2015|2015 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 

==Appearance==
Its blade is primarily red with a silver edge; the tip of the blade has a white fluffy pom-pom, and around the mid-bottom contains a little holly with a candy cane attached to it. It has a bright golden guard, and a red handle with a white beard on the top portion, also partially connected to the heel of the blade, and the bottom portion contains white fluff and a solid black shoe.

==Trivia ==
*It has a [[Santa Gun (2015)|partner gun]] under the same name, making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Santa_Set Santa Set].

